[I] OBEX Server and Client

[T] obexd provides OBEX (Object Exchange) server and client daemons for
[T] Bluetooth with a D-Bus interface. They implement profiles such as Object
[T] Push, File Transfer, Phonebook Access and Synchronization; newer BlueZ
[T] versions include it directly.

[U] https://www.bluez.org/

